1
00:00:00,425 --> 00:00:02,465
Kalau banyak minuman manis, jadi besar.

2
00:00:04,505 --> 00:00:06,725
Sebenarnya, pipis

3
00:00:06,725 --> 00:00:08,905
kita itu tergantung dari suhu ruangan.

4
00:00:10,745 --> 00:00:13,085
Kebutuhan cairan dan suhu ruangan.

5
00:00:14,905 --> 00:00:16,645
Kalau kebutuhan cairannya

6
00:00:16,645 --> 00:00:18,425
berlebih, maka kelebihan cairan tersebut

7
00:00:18,425 --> 00:00:20,265
akan dibuang lewat pipis atau urin.

8
00:00:21,205 --> 00:00:22,525
Semakin suhunya dingin,

9
00:00:22,845 --> 00:00:23,305
maka

10
00:00:23,305 --> 00:00:26,365
kita untuk menstabilkan panas tubuh

11
00:00:26,365 --> 00:00:28,325
harus ngeluarin lewat pipis.

12
00:00:28,425 --> 00:00:30,045
Itu alasan kenapa orang maratoner

13
00:00:30,045 --> 00:00:32,805
yang larinya jauh-jauh,

14
00:00:32,965 --> 00:00:34,545
pas selesai maraton, pipisnya kuning banget

15
00:00:34,545 --> 00:00:36,585
dan jadi sakit. Karena dia kekurangan

16
00:00:36,585 --> 00:00:37,625
cairan jadi retensi.

17
00:00:38,865 --> 00:00:40,685
Nah, untuk orang yang rutin minum manis,

18
00:00:41,825 --> 00:00:42,005
itu

19
00:00:42,005 --> 00:00:44,545
tergantung

20
00:00:44,545 --> 00:00:45,265
seberapa banyak.

21
00:00:46,185 --> 00:00:47,705
Kalau kamu minum manis tapi cuma

22
00:00:47,705 --> 00:00:49,345
segini ya pipisnya dikit.

23
00:00:50,165 --> 00:00:52,065
Nah, yang jadi masalah, kalau kamu minum manis,

24
00:00:52,065 --> 00:00:52,825
kamu tuh nagih.

25
00:00:53,945 --> 00:00:54,745
Paham ya? Nagih.
